LIFECYCLE BASELINE BAKEOFF (R33) — s2/lifecycle_bakeoff.py
Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B, RTX 4090, 6 rounds x 40 facts/stream, 3 SEEDS (complete), grow=+2L/round.
Scaffold-sharing: each (seed,stream) teacher trained ONCE and shared across ours/naive/loramerge
so arm differences are attributable to the METHOD, not to teacher luck. Per-seed JSON dumped
incrementally (partial-safe). "ours" = replay-consolidation (R30 recipe: NO gold, NO inference
memory, single dense checkpoint).

